  "question": {
    "text": "A compound is treated with <math><mtext>N</mtext><mtext>a</mtext><mtext>N</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> to give sodium salt. Identify the compound",
